 "summary": "A red engine-fire warning in flight. Once the path is safe the crew applies the fire procedure without delay: idle, master off, fire pb, agent 1 after 10 s, and agent 2 if the fire is still there 30 s later. When the fire is out, ENG 1(2) SHUT DOWN follows; LAND ASAP. In cruise, the engine-out drift-down strategy is flown around the drill.",
